# Build output graphify's built-in skip list misses because it only matches
# exact names (.next, target). Indexing these grew graph.json past GitHub's
# 100 MB file limit: .next-dev alone was 75k of 108k nodes.

# Next.js dist dirs: named stacks (.next-<stack>) and the map bench (.next-bench)
.next*/
# Cargo target dirs per stack / platform (target-desktop-dev, target-linux-arm64, ...)
target*/
# Tauri-generated schemas and map-bench result dumps
**/src-tauri/gen/
**/bench/results/
